    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18159" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Fĭgŭlus</span></b> ,
			i, m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a Roman surname in the</i> gens Marcia
				<i>and</i> Nigidia. So esp. P. Nigidius Figulus,
				<i>a learned contemporary of Cicero</i>, <i><span class="en">Cic.
				Univ. 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Fam. 4, 13</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Suet.
				Aug. 94</span></i>. — 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Marcius Figulus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Att. 1, 2</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">id.
				Leg. 2, 25</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sall. C. 17</span></i>.</div>
